Wilson, Alan G. E.; Hamman, Brian D.; Rice, Dennis S.; Rawlins, David B.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM ACS Medicinal Chemistry Letters (2015), 6(1), 84-88

